          <Textbox Name="Textbox21">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>WHEREAS, a Notice of Sale, dated : was advertised pursuant to the provision of Section 260 of RA 7160 otherwise known as the Local Government Code (LGC) of 1991, and was served personally and thru registered mail to the declared owner/ person having legal interest therein or authorized representative at his/her registered. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value />
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>WHEREAS, on account of said delinquency, the abovementioned real property was advertised for sale at a public auction to satisfy the amount of delinquent tax, including interest due thereon and the expenses of sale in the total amount of ___</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value />
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>WHEREAS, at the public auction held on ___, the subject property was sold to Mr./Ms _____ a citizen of the Philippines, of legal age and resident of ___ being the highest bidder thereof, for total consideration of _____ , payment is hereby acknowledge received per Official Receipt No.___ , dated ___, sufficient satisfy the amount of taxes, interest due or penalties and expenses of sale thereon. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value />
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>WHEREAS, the declared owner/person having legal interest therein or authorized representative, within the period of one (1) year pursuant to Section 261 of the LGC, failed to redeem the subject property by paying the amount of delinquent tax, including interest due thereon and the expenses of sale from the date of delinquency to the date of sale, plus interest of not more than two percent (2%) per month on the purchase price from the date of sale to the date of redemption.</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value />
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>NOW THEREFORE , the real property under Tax Declaration No.: ___ ARP: ____ PIN: ____ free from any encumbrance or third party claim whatsoever, is hereby conveyed to Mr./Ms. ____ the holder of the certificate of Sale date _____ issued by ____covering the subject property </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value />
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>IN WITNESS WHERE OF , the parties hereto have signed this deed this __ day of ____, ____ in _____, Philippines.</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
